Ques10: Explain the concept of 6 Degrees of Freedom (6DOF) ?
6 Degrees of Freedom (6DOF) means a drone can move in 6 different ways. These are divided into 3 translations and 3 rotations.
Translations (Linear Movement):
X-axis (surge): Moves forward and backward.
Y-axis (Sway): Moves left and right.
Z-axis (Heave): Moves up and down.
Rotations (Angular Movement):
Roll: Tilts left or right.
Pitch: Tilts forward or backward.
Yaw: Rotates left or right.
